.claude/**
*.md
!README.md
imported_characters/**
data/**
# Library = archive of imports (currently ~370 chars in various states
# of completeness). Active characters live in saves/active/ and ARE
# tracked. Anything you want to commit, move out of library/ first.
saves/**
# Review-flagging store (2026-07-09): ephemeral working notes (entry-review
# flags + sheet bug/feature reports), written by save_server /api/flags. Like
# saves/library, local working data — the DB-side reader reads the live file.
reviews/**
__pycache__/**

# Lookup-recall run-over-run baseline (test_lookup_recall.js --save-baseline).
# Deliberately NOT tracked: the ranks it stores are a function of data/dnd35.db,
# which is itself gitignored, so a shared baseline would compare each clone
# against a blob it doesn't have. Local reference point only; it can shift no
# verdict, and the top-N gate in the suite is the thing with teeth.
tests/_recall_baseline.json
